---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到" description="这个页面不存在，返回首页继续浏览。" noindex>
  <section aria-labelledby="not-found-title" class="py-8 sm:py-16">
    <p class="mb-5 text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest text-teal-800">404</p>
    <h1 id="not-found-title" class="text-3xl leading-snug font-semibold tracking-tight text-stone-900 sm:text-4xl">这里还没有内容。</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-md leading-8 text-stone-600">这个地址可能有误，或页面已经移走。可以返回首页，看看最新的笔记。</p>
    <a href="/" class="mt-8 inline-flex rounded-md bg-teal-800 px-5 py-3 font-medium text-white hover:bg-teal-900">返回首页</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
